{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James! Long time no chat. What's up? Been playing any new games lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-f48b5b57fefa5826394032e2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:29.472771+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f48b5b57fefa5826394032e2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f48b5b57fefa5826394032e2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Yeah, it's been a while. I've been busy, but I joined an online gaming tournament yesterday. It was so intense and fun! Here is a photo report."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-0397ad75adaa4abdbaece604", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:33.600190+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0397ad75adaa4abdbaece604", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0397ad75adaa4abdbaece604", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That online gaming tournament looks awesome! Glad you had a blast. How did it go for you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-38a8e484ff3ba5c189a79236", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:37.726613+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "38a8e484ff3ba5c189a79236", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "38a8e484ff3ba5c189a79236", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: It was so much fun! I did pretty well in the tournament; I made it to the semis and won some rounds. It was such a rush! Here's a screenshot of my character."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-dfcb8acc01f5bb1c12a562bd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:41.865846+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dfcb8acc01f5bb1c12a562bd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dfcb8acc01f5bb1c12a562bd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, awesome! Congrats on your performance and making it to the semifinals. How did the final rounds turn out?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-8613cf3c032ee3e5e53ae577", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:45.988094+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8613cf3c032ee3e5e53ae577", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8613cf3c032ee3e5e53ae577", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks John! The final rounds were tough. I tried my best but didn't make it. It was close, though, and I had a blast competing with talented players. Looking forward to the next tournament!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-e29009ca99049ab060d49fe9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:50.098542+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e29009ca99049ab060d49fe9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e29009ca99049ab060d49fe9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Met any famous player there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-0b500f72df47e99cc7d15709", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:54.208276+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0b500f72df47e99cc7d15709", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0b500f72df47e99cc7d15709", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I met the whole team! It\u2019s a pity I didn\u2019t get a chance to take a photo with them, but one of them even gave me a couple of gaming tips."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-8441eca731edf6296c645d0b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:28:58.331390+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8441eca731edf6296c645d0b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8441eca731edf6296c645d0b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool! I'm sure his advice will help you develop in the game."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-d6da7581ac8a7f1432b67daa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:02.422852+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d6da7581ac8a7f1432b67daa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d6da7581ac8a7f1432b67daa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yes, I'm sure of that too. Also, the whole team gave me autographs. I was very happy about this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-dda369bdd3bc5bfa233226fa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:06.536352+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dda369bdd3bc5bfa233226fa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dda369bdd3bc5bfa233226fa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: How cool is this! What advice do you remember most?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-3db6f1237a5792271e84af92", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:10.643109+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3db6f1237a5792271e84af92", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3db6f1237a5792271e84af92", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: The most important thing I remember is that you always need to communicate correctly with the team and never put your ego above team success."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-845262b540827792ffbac463", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:14.786434+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "845262b540827792ffbac463", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "845262b540827792ffbac463", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, comms and teamwork are super important in gaming. When everyone works together, it's incredible what can be accomplished in a match. How do you usually communicate with your team?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-d438f8caa9523a2be35c58ef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:18.956738+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d438f8caa9523a2be35c58ef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d438f8caa9523a2be35c58ef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I usually use voice chat to communicate with my team. It's fast and helps us work together effectively."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-661e0cff7e7eeb50c87d85bb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:23.100348+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "661e0cff7e7eeb50c87d85bb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "661e0cff7e7eeb50c87d85bb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Sounds like a good plan. It really helps with communication. What game do you like playing with your team?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-629b8c788374b38532d8433c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:27.235843+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "629b8c788374b38532d8433c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "629b8c788374b38532d8433c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I've been playing my favourite game called Apex Legends with my team and it's intense! Check out this screenshot of us playing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-7bd13a63792746556993e99b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:31.331426+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7bd13a63792746556993e99b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7bd13a63792746556993e99b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Man, Apex Legends looks tough! The graphics are unreal. How does it stack up against other games?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-7b7d25a9f3677e97dbd4e488", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:35.439298+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7b7d25a9f3677e97dbd4e488", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7b7d25a9f3677e97dbd4e488", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Apex Legends has awesome graphics and super fast-paced gameplay. It definitely stands out among other games."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-7ccb24fcab5e6a5fe7b5200e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:39.566741+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ccb24fcab5e6a5fe7b5200e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ccb24fcab5e6a5fe7b5200e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hmm, the speed of it definitely makes it fun! Are there any new games that you're looking forward to trying out?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-32b0b6003a8ef6f8259993f1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:43.705501+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "32b0b6003a8ef6f8259993f1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "32b0b6003a8ef6f8259993f1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yeah, I'm always excited to try new games. Thinking of trying RPGs like that or MOBAs. Sounds cool!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-4168cdd2b0ab7bedcae29bd6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:47.820751+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4168cdd2b0ab7bedcae29bd6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4168cdd2b0ab7bedcae29bd6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: RPGs and MOBAs can be awesome to experience an engaging story or have epic multiplayer fights. Let me know how you like them!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-9d30acf4fbdc749a162f6198", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:51.941844+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9d30acf4fbdc749a162f6198", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9d30acf4fbdc749a162f6198", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sure thing, John! Can't wait to try out some new genres. I'll definitely let you know my thoughts once I give them a try."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-f700821703d969a702c57fcf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:29:56.066369+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f700821703d969a702c57fcf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f700821703d969a702c57fcf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Love hearing about it. Let's chat soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-a4440f513257a6e6ab7a6bc6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:30:00.192211+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a4440f513257a6e6ab7a6bc6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a4440f513257a6e6ab7a6bc6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sure John, I'll keep you updated on all the new games. Talk to you soon! Bye for now!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-a14f2c4311c733cc86d3ec0b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:30:04.302885+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a14f2c4311c733cc86d3ec0b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a14f2c4311c733cc86d3ec0b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Let me know how it goes. Stay safe. Talk to you soon. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_4-9944295529a51fafddbeae9f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T16:30:08.440769+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9944295529a51fafddbeae9f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9944295529a51fafddbeae9f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
